  "final_message": "<think>The build works and Tailwind CSS is generated (22.48 kB CSS).\n\nWait \u2014 one issue: the CSS is 22kB which seems large for a small app, but Tailwind v4 includes the preflight + theme variables. Let me check that the utility classes I used are present (e.g., `left-4.5` \u2014 is that a valid Tailwind class? `left-4.5` in Tailwind v4 supports fractional spacing values like 4.5 since spacing is computed from `--spacing` (0.25rem * 4.5 = 1.125rem). Yes, v4 supports arbitrary multiples like `left-4.5`.\n\nLet me verify the CSS contains the classes I use.\n\nAlso `text-sky-300`, `bg-slate-950` etc. Let me grep the built CSS for a few.\n\nThen: run the whole app and check the frontend works (fetch the page, check that the JS loads).\n\nLet me also double check the index.html title.</think>\n\n",
